<div class="tab-content"><br>
<div id="detailsTabContent" class="tab-pane active">

    <dl id="descriptorDetails_MagnesiumSulfate"
        class="dl-horizontal">

        <dt>MeSH Heading      </dt>

        <dd>Magnesium Sulfate</dd>

        
                    <dt>Tree Number(s)</dt>
                    
                        <dd><a id="treeNumber_0" onclick=
                               "switchTab([ 'trees', 'treesTabContent' ])"
                            >D01.524.550</a></dd>
                    
                        <dd><a id="treeNumber_1" onclick=
                               "switchTab([ 'trees', 'treesTabContent' ])"
                            >D01.875.800.800.850.500</a></dd>
                    

        <dt>Unique ID</dt><dd>D008278</dd>

        <dt>RDF Unique Identifier</dt>
        <dd><a href="https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008278.html">
            http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D008278
        </a></dd>

        
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>A small colorless crystal used as an anticonvulsant, a cathartic, and an electrolyte replenisher in the treatment of pre-eclampsia and eclampsia. It causes direct inhibition of action potentials in myometrial muscle cells. Excitation and contraction are uncoupled, which decreases the frequency and force of contractions. (From AMA Drug Evaluations Annual, 1992, p1083)</dd>
                </span>
            
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Magnesium Sulfate, Heptahydrate
                    
                </dd>
                <dt>Pharm Action</dt>
                <dd>
                    <a class="textLink_Analgesics"
                       href="/record/ui?ui=D000700"
                    >Analgesics</a><br>
                
                    <a class="textLink_Anesthetics"
                       href="/record/ui?ui=D000777"
                    >Anesthetics</a><br>
                
                    <a class="textLink_Anti-ArrhythmiaAgents"
                       href="/record/ui?ui=D000889"
                    >Anti-Arrhythmia Agents</a><br>
                
                    <a class="textLink_Anticonvulsants"
                       href="/record/ui?ui=D000927"
                    >Anticonvulsants</a><br>
                
                    <a class="textLink_CalciumChannelBlockers"
                       href="/record/ui?ui=D002121"
                    >Calcium Channel Blockers</a><br>
                
                    <a class="textLink_TocolyticAgents"
                       href="/record/ui?ui=D015149"
                    >Tocolytic Agents</a><br>
                </dd>
            
            <dt>Registry Numbers</dt>
            
                    <dd>7487-88-9</dd>
                    
                    <dd>10034-99-8</dd>
                    
            <dt>Related Numbers</dt>
            
                <dd>10034-99-8</dd>
            
            <dt>CAS Type 1 Name</dt><dd>Sulfuric acid magnesium salt (1:1)</dd>
        
        


        
                <dt>Date Introduced</dt>
                <dd>1966/01/01</dd>
            
                <dt>Last Updated</dt>
                <dd>2001/07/25</dd>
            

    </dl>

